{"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/enriched(by:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Enriched.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Enriched.swift#L34"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Destination","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:12Destinations11DestinationPAAE8enriched2byQr6Events8EnricherV_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:12Destinations19InMemoryDestinationV","extendedModule":"Destinations","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"title":"enriched(by:)","symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/enriched(by:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Destination"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"enricher","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What each record this destination receives adds to its context.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that hands this one each batch with its records enriched."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"code":["let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: ownBackend.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[RegionKey.self] = \"eu-west\" }),","    vendor",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher runs on each record of a batch as the delivery hands the batch to this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, not on the tracker’s worker, so what it sets reaches this destination alone:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the others are handed the same records without it. It runs on every record the destination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives, records a store recovered from an earlier run included, and reads any value it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"computes at delivery rather than when the event was tracked. So it suits values about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination or the delivery, such as a region or a deployment tag, rather than about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event: a recovered record would get this run’s app version and the network at upload time."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"first","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sees what ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set and has the last word on a key both set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" adds ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionStarted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":") enricher calls for a batch of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" records."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enricher"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"type":"topic","title":"Destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where tracked events go: the "},{"code":"Destination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches."}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that keeps the newest records it receives, in memory, for the app to read.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"InMemoryDestination","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination/enriched(by:)":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enricher"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/enriched(by:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/enriched(by:)","title":"enriched(by:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"Enricher","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Destination":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a delivery sends events: a plain sink that records the batches it receives."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Destination"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/destination","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"Destination","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Destination"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"}}}